The set of input forms grouped under Drilling and Completion allows 
you to define the details of the well construction operations, from 
drilling to completion.
 
Use the form Drilling Operation to specifiy the topology of the 
borehole and to define the mud weight.
 
Use the form Casing Operation to enter data related to casing 
operation:
- define casing placement
- define casing material and dimensions
 
Use the form Casing Stresses to specify the initial stresses in the 
casing during Waiting On Cement phase:
- assess axial stress distribution
- assess cross-sectional stresses
 
Use the form Cementing Operation to define the fluid weights and 
placement during Waiting On Cement phase.
  